.TH OFFER 1
.SH NAME
offer \- replace a line of the vessel
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B offer
.I SLOT
.I TEXT...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Replaces line
.I SLOT
of
.I /chapter/vessel
with
.IR TEXT .
.I SLOT
is 1 to 36.
.I TEXT
is at most 64 bytes.
.PP
Bytes offered count against the allowance.
.PP
Requires grade novice.
.SH FILES
/chapter/vessel
.SH SEE ALSO
consult(1)
